<title>USA: TRW forms Thai steering unit.</title>
<headline>TRW forms Thai steering unit.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>TRW Inc said Thursday it formed a company in Thailand -- TRW Steering &amp; Suspension Co Ltd -- to produce linkage and suspension components for Australian and other southeast Asian nations and export markets.</p>
<p>Construction of the 40,000 square foot facility is scheduled for completion July 1997.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
